cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite the paper below.
title: "wmmon: monitoring the composition of classifier output"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of control charts for the
  predicted-class composition of a deployed classifier, together with the
  experiment scripts for the accompanying paper. Five stored result files were written by runs whose scripts were not preserved; the README lists them.
